1
00:00:00,075 --> 00:00:02,782
Operasi amputasi tertua di dunia...

2
00:00:02,782 --> 00:00:04,436
ternyata di Kalimantan.

3
00:00:04,436 --> 00:00:05,789
Di gua Liang Tebo,

4
00:00:05,789 --> 00:00:10,000
ditemukan kerangka manusia
purba berumur 31.000 tahun...

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,570
tanpa kaki kiri bawah.

6
00:00:11,570 --> 00:00:13,026
Potongannya rapi.

7
00:00:13,026 --> 00:00:14,333
Bukan digigit hewan.

8
00:00:14,333 --> 00:00:15,564
Tulangnya sembuh.

9
00:00:15,564 --> 00:00:17,927
Ia diamputasi saat masih anak-anak...

10
00:00:17,927 --> 00:00:19,211
Dan selamat!

11
00:00:19,211 --> 00:00:20,291
Rekor sebelumnya:

12
00:00:20,291 --> 00:00:20,940
Prancis,

13
00:00:20,940 --> 00:00:22,500
cuma 7.000 tahun lalu.

14
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:25,150
Ia hidup 6 sampai 9 tahun lagi,

15
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:26,429
dirawat kelompoknya.

16
00:00:26,429 --> 00:00:27,268
Menurutmu,

17
00:00:27,268 --> 00:00:28,421
dipotong pakai apa?

18
00:00:28,421 --> 00:00:29,974
Tulis di komentar!
